## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 4 Max
- **Short description:** Alibaba's Qwen 4 Max frontier multimodal MoE model offering massive 2M context, elite reasoning, and advanced agentic capabilities. Available as `qwen4-max-preview` on Alibaba Cloud Model Studio for complex reasoning, coding, and visual understanding tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (`qwen4-max-preview`), Alibaba Cloud API. Token Plan pricing. No free tier on OpenCode Zen or OpenRouter.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 (preview available on Model Studio as of 2026-11-11); knowledge cutoff not publicly specified.
- **IDs:** `alibaba/qwen-4-max` (Model Studio: `qwen4-max-preview`); no free ID on OpenCode Zen or OpenRouter.
- **Context window:** 2,000,000 total / 128,000 max output (per Model Studio and meta.json)
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio in; text out; reasoning; tool calls; JSON mode
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** ~$2.50 / $10.00 per 1M (input / output) per meta.json and Alibaba Cloud Model Studio pricing; paid API only, no free tier.
- **Architecture:** MoE (Mixture of Experts); proprietary; parameter count not disclosed.

